### Create
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ravi", "salary": 50000}

### List
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/employees

### Empty name
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "salary": 50000}

### Negative salary
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Anita", "salary": -100}